  "query": "-- The tenant's sources after a cursor position, seeking the primary key past it.\nSELECT\n    tenant AS \"tenant: TenantId\",\n    source_key AS \"source_key: TimeSourceId\",\n    owner AS \"owner: PrincipalId\",\n    name,\n    dataset_kind AS \"dataset_kind: TimeDatasetKind\",\n    source_url,\n    expected_content_type,\n    enabled,\n    body,\n    record_version,\n    created_at,\n    updated_at\nFROM time.source\nWHERE tenant = $1 AND source_key > $2\nORDER BY source_key\nLIMIT $3\n",
